When working on the fuzz implementation, or as a coherence check, defining
WUFFS_CONFIG__FUZZLIB_MAIN will let you manually run fuzz over a set of files:

gcc -DWUFFS_CONFIG__FUZZLIB_MAIN webp_fuzzer.c
